        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b2bb92b2-fc85-4817-9499-e49c79e2702e).Image",
        "Description": "47, since our last intreraction with the worlds crime syndicates there has been relative peace. That was, until rumours which were revealed to be true shocked the mob. Lee Hong, the former head of the Red Dragon Triad has made a return after surviving your last attempt on his life. Lee is attempting to restore his Triads former glory and he knows you&apos;re coming. Eliminate Lee&apos;s recruiter and his assassin on the lookout for you then finish off this Old Dragon. I shall leave you to prepare.",
